OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCold, wet and breezy. Cloudy
OL,6,Fwith spells of rain, heaviest around
OL,7,Fmidday over hills. There is a risk of
OL,8,Fsnow and icy roads over the Pennines.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FPatchy
OL,11,Frain to start on Wednesday, but later
OL,12,Fdry, cloudy and cold. Longer breaks to
OL,13,Fsunshine on Thursday, but cold. Rain,
OL,14,Fstrengthening winds, and hill snow
OL,15,Freturning later on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
